        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>5411 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="white" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;12/19/2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 07:41:00</font>

        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=3"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://mikeshea.net/everquest/" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Loral's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Due to the powerful skills and coordination of the four greatest groups I have had the oppertunity to adventure with we were able to penetrate the den of Iceshard Keep and defeat the Brothers Iceshard!  Though a bit of a rocky start requiring us to wait around and pull a bit outside, we finally managed to summon the traterous dwarf and defeat his powerful guards!  Loot included corroded plate bracer (rotted =( ), plate arms, plate legs, plate boots, two plate helms, two plate gauntlets, a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4089" target="_blank">Vehement Sword of Reivaj</a> and a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=3969" target="_blank">Rune Etched Iceworm Fang</a>.  Much information was gathered during the raid and I will soon update the  <a href="http://www.mikeshea.net/everquest/iceshard.html" target="_blank">Raiders Guide to Iceshard Keep</a>.</P><P><a href="http://mikeshea.net/everquest/images/iceshard_brothers.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="http://mikeshea.net/everquest/images/iceshard_brothers_t.jpg" border=0></a></font></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="ccccff" valign="top">

		<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=99">

		<font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><b>gadal</a>
        </b></font>

        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>Guest</small></font>

        <br>
        <br>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>24 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="ccccff" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;12/19/2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 09:22:23</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=99"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        

        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I had a fabulous time Loral.  It was a great raid, and a learning exp too!!</P><P>/makes funny gestures about a d0rf living</P><P>I only wish I was able to stay longer.</P><P><BR>Gadal</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

