        <br><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0>
        <br>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>6021 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="white" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;12/19/2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 12:07:38</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=5"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://healersunited.com" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Juror's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> *cheers*</P><P>Glad it went so well.  I had to work late and missed all the fun.</P><P>*pouts*</P><P>So when do we go back, Loral?</P><P>*grins*</P><P>Juror Beaumains<BR>Mystic of the Tribunal <BR>(the TDHN events coercer... err coordinator)<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
