      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="ccccff" valign="top">

		<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=8">

		<font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><b>Mysstie Wolfestar</a>
        </b></font>

        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>Friend</small></font>

        <br><img src=icon_star_orange.gif border=0>
        <br>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>1075 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="ccccff" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;12/19/2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 16:29:01</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=8"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://www.companyofvalor.org" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Mysstie Wolfestar's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> <BR>Great job Loral and everyone else.  I had alot of fun and was so glad I was able to go fetch my husband and have him join us, he really enjoyed it.  :)  Luckily, none of the giants on the way to our camp spot could see through invisibility.  </P><P>*hugs*</P><P></P><P><BR>Mysstie Wolfestar<BR>55th Season Preserver of Tunare<BR>Empress, Company of Valor<BR><a href="http://www.companyofvalor.org" target="_blank">www.companyofvalor.org</a><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
