        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> /agree with everyone here, Loral as i posted in the general section you did a great job and this was alot of fun, i was glad to win a piece of plate as well, only feel bad as others didnt get a chance at there armor, but we defiantely know where to go if we need corroded plate heheheheh. :) i hope we go back soon!!!</P><P>Ertemis Entreri        41st Cleric of Dahlea.<BR>Devoted Cleric of HU, Also Skythe 52 Bruiser<BR>Knight of COV!!<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
